const steps=[['idea','Business','Define the idea, customers and budget.'],['users','Work method','Choose manual, AI-assisted or mixed.'],['search','Analyze','Validate the idea and plan a first release.'],['layers','Set up','Choose tools and connect existing resources.'],['list','Roadmap','Prioritize concrete P0 and P1 tasks.'],['clock','Execute','Coordinate work and optional schedules.'],['shield','Launch','Verify real evidence before going live.'],['chart','Operate','Track costs, revenue and improvements.']];
const features=[['list','Know what to build next','Turn an idea or an existing codebase into a prioritized roadmap. Review requirements, dependencies and acceptance criteria.'],['bot','Work with your own assistants','Use your preferred ChatGPT or Claude plan, or work entirely manually. Keep control of permissions and decisions.'],['layers','Choose the right tools','Compare hosting, databases, payments, email and other services. Start small and reuse existing accounts.'],['wallet','Keep costs in view','Plan against a spending ceiling. Review estimated costs before adding services; verify real usage and recurring bills separately.'],['shield','Launch with evidence','Track launch-blocking work, testing and owner approvals rather than treating a completed task as a verified release.'],['chart','See the business, not just the code','The private workspace combines project development, financial review, operations and communications. Commercial integrations are still being developed.']];
const faqs=[['What is Project Zero?','Project Zero is a guided business and software project workspace in private development. It brings idea validation, platform selection, development priorities, execution and business oversight into a single workflow. The public platform guides are available now.'],['Do I need a paid AI subscription?','No. The intended workflow supports manual work without an AI account. ChatGPT and Claude can help with planning and execution where the selected plan and permissions allow. Scheduled work and connected tools depend on the provider and subscription.'],['Can I bring an existing project?','Yes, the private workflow supports adding existing projects and recording repository links and service choices. It does not automatically import or grant access to external accounts.'],['Does Project Zero pay for hosting or create accounts?','No. The platform guides help you compare services. Any setup or purchase requires your own authorization, provider account and applicable fees.'],['Can I sign up today?','Authorized account holders can sign in with Google. Public account registration and paid subscriptions are not available. The demo and guides remain available without an account.']];
